{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["search_document: North orchard pump NP-7 carries asset tag ORC-771.","search_document: The parts pickup for pump NP-7 is scheduled at the east shed counter.","search_document: Pump NP-7 uses the blue intake valve during the spring irrigation cycle.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the south orchard tractor receives a separate oil change.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the packing barn scales use another calibration weight.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the west field gate has an unrelated hinge inspection.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the irrigation office files a different permit copy.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the harvest crates are counted in another ledger.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the compost mixer follows a separate belt schedule.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the orchard map marks an unrelated drainage ditch.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the tool trailer carries a different socket set.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the beekeeper checks another apiary entrance.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the weather station posts an unrelated frost alert.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the cold room logs a separate temperature reading.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the pruning crew receives another route card.","search_document: orchard pump maintenance: the tractor shed stores an unrelated battery charger."],"truncate":false}